<p>(b) The results for the nine month period ended December 30, 1995, include a $19.4 million write-off of in-process technology relating to the purchase of NeoCAD Inc.  Excluding the impact of the write-off of in-process technology, income before taxes, net income and net income per share were $136.9 million, $86.9 million and $1.10 respectively for the nine month period ended December 30, 1995.</p>
